Package: linux-modules-@REL@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: zhongfu <me@zhongfu.li>
Depends: linux-image-@REL@ (= @VERSION@)
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: ZSpace T2 kernel modules @REL@
 The loadable kernel modules built with the ZSpace T2 kernel, installed under
 /lib/modules/@REL@/.
 .
 The directory name is the release string baked into the kernel Image, and the
 version is tied to linux-image-@REL@ exactly, so an Image can never be
 installed without the modules it was built against.
